<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#5f4788; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 20px; background-color: rgb(95, 71, 136);">Dear Patron,</span><br style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 20px; background-color: rgb(95, 71, 136);"><br style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 20px; background-color: rgb(95, 71, 136);"><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 20px; background-color: rgb(95, 71, 136);">We would like to take this opportunity to welcome you to the array of our esteemed customers and feel deeply humbled for the trust you have placed in our organization.</span><br style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 20px; background-color: rgb(95, 71, 136);"><br style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 20px; background-color: rgb(95, 71, 136);"><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 20px; background-color: rgb(95, 71, 136);">At Monster.com, we pride ourselves in offering responsive, competent and scalable recruitment solutions to help you find better and leverage your company’s core asset -&nbsp;</span><em style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 20px; background-color: rgb(95, 71, 136);">YOUR PEOPLE.&nbsp;</em><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 20px; background-color: rgb(95, 71, 136);">We foster this commitment through our excellent services and support, coordinated by a steering team dedicated to your account.&nbsp;</span><br style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 20px; background-color: rgb(95, 71, 136);"><br style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 20px; background-color: rgb(95, 71, 136);"><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 20px; background-color: rgb(95, 71, 136);">For business related queries or suggestions, please get in touch with us through our helpline numbers given in the right panel.</span><br style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 20px; background-color: rgb(95, 71, 136);"><br style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 20px; background-color: rgb(95, 71, 136);"><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 20px; background-color: rgb(95, 71, 136);">Thank you for choosing us. Looking forward to a great business association with you.&nbsp;</span><br style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 20px; background-color: rgb(95, 71, 136);"><br style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 20px; background-color: rgb(95, 71, 136);"><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 20px; background-color: rgb(95, 71, 136);">Sincerely,</span><br style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 20px; background-color: rgb(95, 71, 136);"><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 20px; background-color: rgb(95, 71, 136);">Team Monster</span>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>
</td>
